messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 85 and 37? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo solve the math problem of finding the product of 85 and 37, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's a step-by-step breakdown:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n   ```.\n     85.\n   x 37.\n   ----.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply 85 by the ones digit of 37 (which is 7):.\n   ```.\n     85.\n   x  7.\n   ----.\n    595.\n   ```.\n\n3. Multiply 85 by the tens digit of 37 (which is 3), but remember to shift the result one position to the left because we're dealing with tens:.\n   ```.\n     85.\n   x 30.\n   ----.\n   2550.\n   ```.\n\n4. Add the two results together (595 and 2550):.\n   ```.\n     595.\n   +2550.\n   ----.\n   3145.\n   ```.\n\nSo, the product of 85 and 37 is 3145.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
