messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 74 and 64? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the product of 74 and 64, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's a step-by-step breakdown:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n   ```.\n     74.\n   x 64.\n   ----.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply 74 by 4 (the ones digit of 64):.\n   ```.\n     74.\n   x  4.\n   ----.\n     296.\n   ```.\n\n3. Multiply 74 by 60 (the tens digit of 64, which is 6 times 10):.\n   ```.\n     74.\n   x 60.\n   ----.\n    4440.\n   ```.\n\n4. Add the two results together:.\n   ```.\n     296.\n   +4440.\n   ----.\n    4736.\n   ```.\n\nSo, the product of 74 and 64 is 4736.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
