messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 71 and 56? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo solve the math problem of finding the product of 71 and 56, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's a step-by-step breakdown:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n   ```.\n     71.\n   x 56.\n   ----.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply 71 by the ones digit of 56 (which is 6):.\n   ```.\n     71.\n   x  6.\n   ----.\n     426.\n   ```.\n\n3. Multiply 71 by the tens digit of 56 (which is 5), but remember to shift the result one position to the left because we're dealing with tens:.\n   ```.\n     71.\n   x 50.\n   ----.\n    3550.\n   ```.\n\n4. Add the two results together (426 and 3550):.\n   ```.\n     426.\n   +3550.\n   ----.\n    3976.\n   ```.\n\nSo, the product of 71 and 56 is 3976.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
