messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 31 and 78? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo solve the math problem of finding the product of 31 and 78, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's a step-by-step breakdown:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n   ```.\n     31.\n   x 78.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply 31 by the ones digit of 78 (which is 8):.\n   ```.\n     31.\n   x  78.\n   ------.\n     248  (This is 31 x 8).\n   ```.\n\n3. Multiply 31 by the tens digit of 78 (which is 7), but remember to shift the result one position to the left because we're dealing with tens:.\n   ```.\n     31.\n   x  78.\n   ------.\n     248.\n   + 2170  (This is 31 x 70, shifted one place to the left).\n   ```.\n\n4. Add the two results together:.\n   ```.\n     248.\n   +2170.\n   ------.\n    2418.\n   ```.\n\nSo, the product of 31 and 78 is 2418.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
