messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 17 and 82? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo solve the math problem of finding the product of 17 and 82, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's a step-by-step breakdown:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n   ```.\n     17.\n   x 82.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply 17 by the ones digit of 82 (which is 2):.\n   ```.\n     17.\n   x  82.\n   ------.\n     34  (This is 17 x 2).\n   ```.\n\n3. Multiply 17 by the tens digit of 82 (which is 8), but remember to shift the result one position to the left because we're dealing with tens:.\n   ```.\n     17.\n   x  82.\n   ------.\n     34.\n   +1360  (This is 17 x 8, shifted one place to the left).\n   ```.\n\n4. Add the two results together:.\n   ```.\n     17.\n   x  82.\n   ------.\n     34.\n   +1360.\n   ------.\n    1404.\n   ```.\n\nSo, the product of 17 and 82 is 1404.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
