messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 48 and 98? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo solve the math problem of finding the product of 48 and 98, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's a step-by-step breakdown:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n   ```.\n     48.\n   x 98.\n   ----.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply 48 by the ones digit of 98 (which is 8):.\n   ```.\n     48.\n   x  8.\n   ----.\n     384.\n   ```.\n\n3. Multiply 48 by the tens digit of 98 (which is 9), but remember to shift the result one position to the left because we're dealing with tens:.\n   ```.\n     48.\n   x 90.\n   ----.\n    4320.\n   ```.\n\n4. Add the two results together (384 and 4320):.\n   ```.\n     384.\n   +4320.\n   ----.\n    4704.\n   ```.\n\nSo, the product of 48 and 98 is 4704.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
