messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 81 and 61? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo solve the math problem of finding the product of 81 and 61, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's a step-by-step breakdown:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n   ```.\n     81.\n   x 61.\n   ----.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply 81 by the ones digit of 61 (which is 1):.\n   ```.\n     81.\n   x  1.\n   ----.\n     81.\n   ```.\n\n3. Multiply 81 by the tens digit of 61 (which is 6), but remember to shift the result one position to the left because we're dealing with tens:.\n   ```.\n     81.\n   x 60.\n   ----.\n    4860.\n   ```.\n\n4. Add the two results together:.\n   ```.\n     81.\n   +4860.\n   ----.\n    5741.\n   ```.\n\nSo, the product of 81 and 61 is 5,041.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
