messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 73 and 74? Please reason step by step.', '<think>.\nTo solve the math problem of finding the product of 73 and 74, we can use the distributive property of multiplication over addition. This property states that a(b + c) = ab + ac. In this case, we can rewrite 74 as 73 + 1. So, the product of 73 and 74 can be calculated as follows:.\n\n73 * 74 = 73 * (73 + 1).\n         = 73 * 73 + 73 * 1.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         = 5329 + 73.\n         =