messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 35 and 56? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo solve the math problem of finding the product of 35 and 56, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's a step-by-step breakdown:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n   ```.\n     35.\n   x 56.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply 35 by the ones digit of 56 (which is 6):.\n   ```.\n     35.\n   x  6.\n   ----.\n     210.\n   ```.\n\n3. Multiply 35 by the tens digit of 56 (which is 5), but remember to shift the result one position to the left because we're dealing with tens:.\n   ```.\n     35.\n   x 50.\n   ----.\n    1750.\n   ```.\n\n4. Add the two results together (210 and 1750):.\n   ```.\n     210.\n   +1750.\n   ----.\n    1960.\n   ```.\n\nSo, the product of 35 and 56 is 1960.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
