messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 57 and 53? Please reason step by step.', '<think>.\nTo solve the math problem of finding the product of 57 and 53, we can use the distributive property of multiplication over addition. This property states that a(b + c) = ab + ac. In this case, we can rewrite 57 and 53 as (50 + 7) and (50 - 7), respectively. Then, we can apply the distributive property as follows:.\n\n(50 + 7)(50 - 7) = 50(50 - 7) + 7(50 - 7).\n\nNow, we can use the distributive property again to expand the expression:.\n\n50(50 - 7) + 7(50 - 7) = 50(50) - 50(7) + 7(50) - 7(7).\n\nNext, we can simplify the expression by performing the multiplications:.\n\n50(50) - 50(7) + 7(50) - 7(7) = 2500 - 350 + 350 - 49.\n\nFinally, we can add and subtract the terms to find the product:.\n\n2500 - 350 + 350 - 49 = 2500 - 49 = 2451.\n\nTherefore, the product of 57 and 53 is 2451.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: ']]
