messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 49 and 65? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo solve the math problem of finding the product of 49 and 65, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's a step-by-step breakdown:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n   ```.\n     49.\n   x 65.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply 49 by the ones digit of 65 (which is 5):.\n   ```.\n     49.\n   x  5.\n   ----.\n    245.\n   ```.\n\n3. Multiply 49 by the tens digit of 65 (which is 6), but remember to shift the result one position to the left because we're dealing with tens:.\n   ```.\n     49.\n   x 60.\n   ----.\n   2940.\n   ```.\n\n4. Add the two results together (245 and 2940):.\n   ```.\n     245.\n   +2940.\n   ----.\n   3185.\n   ```.\n\nSo, the product of 49 and 65 is 3185.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
