messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 11 and 79? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo solve the math problem of finding the product of 11 and 79, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's a step-by-step breakdown:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n   ```.\n     11.\n   x 79.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply 11 by the ones digit of 79 (which is 9):.\n   ```.\n     11.\n   x 79.\n   ---.\n     99.\n   ```.\n\n3. Multiply 11 by the tens digit of 79 (which is 7), but remember to shift the result one position to the left because we're dealing with tens:.\n   ```.\n     11.\n   x 79.\n   ---.\n     99.\n   + 770.\n   ```.\n\n4. Add the two results together:.\n   ```.\n     11.\n   x 79.\n   ---.\n     99.\n   + 770.\n   ---.\n    869.\n   ```.\n\nSo, the product of 11 and 79 is 869.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
