messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 31 and 31? Please reason step by step.', '<think>.\nTo solve the math problem of finding the product of 31 and 31, we can use the following steps:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers to be multiplied: 31 and 31.\n2. Multiply the ones digit of the first number (1) by the ones digit of the second number (1): 1 x 1 = 1.\n3. Multiply the tens digit of the first number (3) by the ones digit of the second number (1): 3 x 1 = 3.\n4. Multiply the ones digit of the first number (1) by the tens digit of the second number (3): 1 x 3 = 3.\n5. Multiply the tens digit of the first number (3) by the tens digit of the second number (3): 3 x 3 = 9.\n6. Add the products of the individual digits: 1 + 3 + 3 + 9 = 16.\n7. Write down the result: 961.\n\nTherefore, the product of 31 and 31 is 961.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: ']]
